
Please read the XNAT documentation on ldap authentication configuration.

Edit the *-provider.properties file(s) with your authenticator server(s).

Run:

    cd /path/to/xnat-setup/Linux/ldap && ./build_ldap_image.sh

Change the docker image used by xnat-web in docker-compose.yml to xnat:{xnat version}ldap and run ./restart.sh

In User Auth Settings add additional authenticator, for example:

    localdb,ldapsandbox

The dockerfile-add-ldap file adds the authenticator properties file inside the container:

    /data/xnat/home/config/auth/

